{"title":"Google Scholar Labs","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/928260335/0/marginalrevolution~Google-Scholar-Labs.html","date":1763612825000,"content":"<p>Brings AI to Google Scholar, find it <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://scholar.google.com/scholar_labs/search\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.  Via<a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/joshgans\" target=\"_blank\"> Joshua Gans</a>.  And yes this does mean that the academics also are, or at least ought to be, writing for the AIs.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/11/google-scholar-labs.html\">Google Scholar Labs</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/928260335/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/928260335/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/928260335/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/928260335/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/928260335/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/928260335/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/11/google-scholar-labs.html#respond\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.c